WEBVTT

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:03.976
We'd paint to make them stand out
like Monopoly pieces

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:05.280
in these environments.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:09.096
And we'd go on these early Sunday mornings

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:13.920
and keep going until we ran out
of that paint or until someone complained.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:20.600
"Hey, did you paint that?"

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:25.240
a driver asked as I was taking
this image one day.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:27.416
Me, nervously:

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:28.640
"Yes?"

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.776
His face changed.